    "detailed_description": "The first <strong>Macabre Stage</strong> presents to you the <strong>Cursed Cartridge</strong>, a story you must uncover as you reveal the secrets of an ancient cartridge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/9ff7ed505b8676a16e874f3ad5f2b8b6.poster.avif?t=1713282707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/9ff7ed505b8676a16e874f3ad5f2b8b6.webm?t=1713282707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/9ff7ed505b8676a16e874f3ad5f2b8b6.mp4?t=1713282707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But be careful, something doesn't want you to know the truth and will be lurking in the darkness. Make sure to close your windows tightly because something tells you that you shouldn't have gotten involved in this mystery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/0098029af0e84ae0847334b897f83c96.poster.avif?t=1713282707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/0098029af0e84ae0847334b897f83c96.webm?t=1713282707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/0098029af0e84ae0847334b897f83c96.mp4?t=1713282707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game may seem like a normal Japanese game, but it actually has several secret paths that will lead you to different peculiar routes. Will you be able to achieve the best ending?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/0b72903638ec84c2d0502c7595c8f45f.poster.avif?t=1713282707\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/0b72903638ec84c2d0502c7595c8f45f.webm?t=1713282707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627630/extras/0b72903638ec84c2d0502c7595c8f45f.mp4?t=1713282707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
